    {
      "id": "product_inventory_1step_smallest_rotated_box_001",
      "category": "product_inventory",
      "step_count": 1,
      "user_prompt": "I need to pack a framed print measuring 62 by 44 by 7 centimeters, with 3 centimeters of padding on every side. Among the shipping boxes available at the Zhongshan branch, which smallest-volume box will fit if I may rotate it by 90 degrees but not place it diagonally?",
      "flow_summary": "查中山分店的原始箱內尺寸與可售量；模型先把每個維度加上雙側緩衝，再以三邊互換判斷能否放入，最後在合格者中算體積並取最小。",
      "tools": [
        {
          "name": "list_shipping_box_inventory",
          "description": "Return every shipping box sold at the requested branch, including inner dimensions and raw on-hand and reserved quantities. It does not calculate sellable quantity, fit, volume, or a recommendation.",
