      "expected_final_answer": "Choose Lot C. It can supply the three continuous pieces from its 2.5, 2.5, and 1.5 meter rolls and leaves 0.6 meter total. Lot A can also fulfill the cuts but leaves 1.1 meters. Lot B cannot produce two separate 2.4-meter panels because only one roll is at least 2.4 meters long.",
